{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoEzAGyaRpMSuNQoAGg1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I rewrote `split` in `ledgerkit/money.py` to use the largest remainder method with integer arithmetic only. `python3 -m pytest -q` passes (9 passed), and I committed the change as `b6ed0dd`.\n\n- **How it works:** each party gets the floor of its exact share, using `//` and `%` on integers. The leftover cents go to the largest remainders, with ties going to the lower index.\n- **Negative totals:** these split like the absolute value, with every result negated.\n- **Errors:** it raises `ValueError` for empty weights, any negative weight, or all-zero weights.\n- **Tests:** I added tests to `tests/test_money.py` for:\n  - exact sums and remainder ordering\n  - negative totals\n  - zero weights and a zero total\n  - a very large total\n  - the three error cases\n\nI assumed the weights are integers. Float weights would probably still work, but they wouldn't be exact."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":182,"cache_read_input_tokens":33483,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":182},"output_tokens":305,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c80d8e3-997f-4a40-b693-91dd544cf64e","uuid":"097f7f2d-b580-402a-af05-68971fc6c0cb","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:20:39.288Z","request_id":"req_011CgoEzA7Yhy1EL8dbcVaLT"}
